  "checklists": {
    "_doc": "Long-form structured pieces. Both deferred from the studio-audio rollout pending a structural fix: their <main id='post-body'> wraps multiple sibling <section> elements with nested <div class='container'> wrappers. The chunk extractor's nth-of-type direct-child selectors don't resolve through that nesting, so the on-page highlight would silently fail on every chunk. Two routes forward: (a) restructure each checklist's HTML so audio-eligible h2/p/li are direct children of post-body, or (b) ship a recursive chunk extractor with stable data-audio-chunk-id attributes (TODO).",
    "audit-any-tool": {
